b6dbf26 docs: update progress log for S25 Timeline Placer Component

The Timeline Placer Component (S25) is now complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

## Implementation Summary

### Components Created
- **TimelinePlacer.tsx**: Drag-and-drop style component for placing songs on timeline
  - Shows existing timeline cards sorted by year
  - Drop zones between cards for selecting insertion point
  - New song card display (title/artist visible, year hidden)
  - Calls `rounds.setPlacementPreview` mutation on position change
  - Submit button calls `rounds.submitPlacement` mutation
  - Visual feedback for placement position (First/Last/After X)

- **TimelinePlacer.test.tsx**: 4 passing component tests

### Integration
- **CurrentRoundPanel.tsx**: Updated to render TimelinePlacer when it's the player's turn during the placing phase
- **GameView.tsx**: Passes required props (lobbyId, me, existingPreviewIndex) to CurrentRoundPanel

### Test Infrastructure
- Added `@testing-library/jest-dom` dependency
- Updated `vitest.config.ts` with path aliases for `@/*` and `@/convex/*`
- Updated `vitest.setup.ts` with jest-dom vitest integration

### Commits
- `75db872` - feat(game): Implement TimelinePlacer component
- `b6dbf26` - docs: update progress log

All acceptance criteria met:
- ✅ Turn player sees timeline with insertion points
- ✅ Can tap to select position  
- ✅ Preview updates in real-time
- ✅ Submit button finalizes placement
